MovieSnack — a web application that randomly pairs food with movies based on their genre. Whether you're watching cartoons and craving gummy bears, or diving into a horror film with a plate of steak, MovieSnack suggests the perfect snack to match the mood of your movie night.

Features:

Random food selection based on movie genre

Genre-based pairing logic (e.g., candy for animation, meat for horror)

Simple, intuitive web interface

Extensible food-genre database

Tech Stack: (to be defined)

Goal: Make every movie night a little more fun by removing the "what should I eat?" question — and adding a thematic twist to it.
